<br>
It is hard to belive that people can be so kind as to go to Solb, loot GEB's, and rather than sell them, give them to someone that was not even there.  <br>
<br>
/thank all involved<br>
<br>
Tal <p></p><i></i></td></tr><tr bgcolor=#999999><td nowrap width=20% valign=top align=left><span class=title><A HREF="http://www.ezboard.com/promotions/csc.html" TARGET="_blank" ><IMG SRC="http://www.ezboard.com/image/cscicon3.gif" WIDTH="20" HEIGHT="20" BORDER="0" align="absmiddle"></A> <A HREF=http://pub14.ezboard.com/usyrlisplendyr.showPublicProfile?language=EN>Syrli Splendyr</A>&nbsp; <IMG HEIGHT=10 WIDTH=10 SRC=http://home.earthlink.net/~b9space/_images/skull01.gif width=10 hieght=10 BORDER=0></span><br> <span class=usertitle>ezOp</span><br> <font color=#000000>(8/13/01 12:05:55 pm)</font><br>     <br>Community Supporter<br> <BR><img src=http://home.earthlink.net/~b9space/_images/ss.jpg width=102 hieght=150></td><td valign=top align=left class=m><span class=title> Re: Great Big Thanks!</span><hr size=1> You're quite welcome <!--EZCODE EMOTICON START :) --><img src=http://www.ezboard.com/intl/aenglish/images/emoticons/smile.gif ALT=":)"><!--EZCODE EMOTICON END--> <br>
